{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/competency_evidence_kind

    The words of a platform record's kind on the evidence page, one literal string per kind flag (the flags are
    theme_dimensions/competencyevidence's, from the service's kind). Included by competency_evidence_records.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * isactivity, iscourse, isrule, israting, isrestore, isunlinked, isrecord - one of them true

    Example context (json):
    {
        "israting": true
    }
}}
{{#isactivity}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_activity, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/isactivity}}{{!
}}{{#iscourse}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_course, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/iscourse}}{{!
}}{{#isrule}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_rule, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/isrule}}{{!
}}{{#israting}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_rating, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/israting}}{{!
}}{{#isrestore}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_restore, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/isrestore}}{{!
}}{{#isunlinked}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_unlinked, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/isunlinked}}{{!
}}{{#isrecord}}{{#str}} competency_evidencekind_record, theme_dimensions {{/str}}{{/isrecord}}
